{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STRIK9 fuses the frantic, rewarding chaos of Bullet Heaven games with Rhythm action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a tale of adventure and comical hijinks! Join Strik and his pals, a band of music-loving critters, as they journey through a dystopian wasteland controlled by a rhythm-obsessed hive mind.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their mission? Fight the synchronized oppression and search for epic tunes to bring life back to the world, one beat at a time. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rhythm Meets Roguelite</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beat-Based Combat\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Attack and unleash special moves only if you stay on beat. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642210/extras/7c6a07e2bc22f0558f012303df123ebc.poster.avif?t=1773927508\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642210/extras/7c6a07e2bc22f0558f012303df123ebc.webm?t=1773927508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642210/extras/7c6a07e2bc22f0558f012303df123ebc.mp4?t=1773927508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Depth</strong> - Explore different ways to engage with your environment. Dodge aggressively, or stand your ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642210/extras/b35aefc57a9b0afbfb8564f5b789687a.poster.avif?t=1773927508\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642210/extras/b35aefc57a9b0afbfb8564f5b789687a.webm?t=1773927508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642210/extras/b35aefc57a9b0afbfb8564f5b789687a.mp4?t=1773927508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer the Rat Race</strong> - Battle it out on the Steam leaderboard and prove you're the raddest rhythm rat. Hit the beats, top the charts, and squeak your way to glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642210/extras/696cc236e75f18ef2e1a5f3580f74a7a.avif?t=1773927508\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression That Plays Well</strong> \u2013 Unlock new companions, weapons and skills that bring new abilities to the battlefield across multiple runs. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642210/extras/164ea52e1d57d481ce4036206f227e87.poster.avif?t=1773927508\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642210/extras/164ea52e1d57d481ce4036206f227e87.webm?t=1773927508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642210/extras/164ea52e1d57d481ce4036206f227e87.mp4?t=1773927508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Story Woven in Sound</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a music-fueled mystery where the soundtrack isn\u2019t just background\u2014it\u2019s the key to saving a world ruled by rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb